<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><div><div><font face="arial"><a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/orientation">New Student Orientation</a> is a one-day, on-campus program incoming students are expected to attend before the fall semester begins.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>During orientation, you will:</b></font></div><div><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">meet with your academic college and learn about academic expectations</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">complete course selections and registration for the upcoming semester</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">meet with current students and new classmates</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">explore ways to get involved on campus</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">learn about the university’s services and resources</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">visit a residence hall community</span></li></ul></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you are unable to attend orientation due to extenuating circumstances, please contact your academic advisor to discuss alternative class registration options. (There is no guarantee that a special accommodation can be made.) Your advisor's contact information can be found in <a href="http://my.asu.edu/">My ASU</a> under <b>My Programs and eAdvisor</b></font><span id="docs-internal-guid-adaf8ba4-76c1-8d95-4bc7-c98ccef700b7"><span style="font-size: 10px; font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: super; white-space: pre-wrap;">TM</span></span><font face="arial">.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>